      "title": "Adjunct",
      "description": "Posted: 2024-03-26\n\nLocation: Salt Lake City\n\nWestminster University Adjunct Westminster University invites individuals to apply to the position of adjunct faculty. This position is intended to gather an applicant pool and has no official end date. We invite you to apply at any time, and indicate your department of interest in your materials. The Provost's Office, Academic Deans and Program Chairs will be reviewing applications each semester, and will contact applicants associated with those specific needs at that time.  Equal\nEmployment Opportunity: Westminster University is\ncommitted to a diversified workforce, equal opportunity, and nondiscrimination.\nTo this end, Westminster prohibits any form of discrimination or harassment\nbased on race or ethnicity, color, religion, national origin, sex, age, sexual\norientation, gender identification, disabilities, genetic information, status\nas a veteran, or any other category or classification protected by applicable\nfederal, state, or city laws.",
